hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1783","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaey aur apni qasam mein kahey: Laat aur Uzza ki qasam! To use kehna chaahiye: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi! Aur jo apne saathi se kahey: Aao main tum se juwa khelun! To use sadqa karna chaahiye. (Bukhari: 4860). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Balke Qiyaamat unka waada hai aur Qiyaamat zyada sakht aur kadwi hai)."
